<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ruby-sanctum">Updates for Best in Slot Gear in Ruby Sanctum</h3>Ruby Sanctum almost exclusively brings off-piece options, which is great for us as our Tier is as powerful as ever. The main item we want is the same as almost every caster, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54588/charred-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charred Twilight Scale</span></a>. While this Trinket will likely be an upgrade, if you already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50348/dislodged-foreign-object">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dislodged Foreign Object</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50365/phylactery-of-the-nameless-lich">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Phylactery of the Nameless Lich</span></a> then you don't need to be in a hurry to get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54588/charred-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charred Twilight Scale</span></a>. The stats are very similar to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50348/dislodged-foreign-object">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dislodged Foreign Object</span></a>, only without the ramp-up time for Spell Power. <br/>
<br/>Moving around some pieces also allows us to take advantage of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54582/bracers-of-fiery-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Fiery Night</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54583/cloak-of-burning-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Burning Dusk</span></a>, as long as we can maintain our Hit cap. This can be achieved by swapping <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50724/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Silent Eulogy</span></a> for Horde, but Alliance need a bit more tweaking to fully min-max their stats.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> should primarily be spent building your Tier 10 set. Each piece can be upgraded into the equivalent 264 piece, which is then upgraded into the 277 piece. This means that you will end up needing to pick all of these up even if you never plan on equipping the 251 versions. Outside of Tier there are limited options. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50469/voldes-cloak-of-the-night-sky">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Volde's Cloak of the Night Sky</span></a> can be alright if you are in need of a Cloak, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50996/belt-of-omission">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Omission</span></a> can also pick up some slack if you are missing Hit. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50357/maghias-misguided-quill">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maghia's Misguided Quill</span></a> is unlikely to be used, but if you somehow need a large amount of Hit it is an option. <br/>
