<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>The differences from Cloak to Cloak are miniscule. Getting your hands on any of the top options will be more than enough to keep you competitive. As of Phase 4, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54583/cloak-of-burning-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Burning Dusk</span></a> does have a bit of an edge over the Phase 4 options, but not enough to make or break your DPS.<br/>
<br/>
