<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>Both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50722/sanlayn-ritualist-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">San'layn Ritualist Gloves</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50663/gunship-captains-mittens">
