<span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Crimson Acolyte's Regalia</span></a>, so <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51256/sanctified-crimson-acolyte-handwraps">
