<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>Legs are the ideal slot to skip Tier. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50694/plaguebringers-stained-pants">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plaguebringer's Stained Pants</span></a> gives you a significant Hit boost that can open up other slots for higher DPS options. If you don't need the Hit, consider opting for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51258/sanctified-crimson-acolyte-pants">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Crimson Acolyte Pants</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=56039/sanctified-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Spellthread</span></a> if you are a Tailor and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41602/brilliant-spellthread">
