<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50699/plague-scientists-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plague Scientist's Boots</span></a> are incredible, but highly contested. If you already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a> from Phase 3, focus your attention elsewhere. Those of you with more gold than time may want to pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49893/sandals-of-consecration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of Consecration</span></a> provided you don't already have better.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> if you are an Engineer and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60623/enchant-boots-icewalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Icewalker</span></a> for everyone else, depending on if you can use the Hit.<div class="pad"></div>
