<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>Cherish it, love it, whisper sweet nothings to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50398/ashen-band-of-endless-destruction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Destruction</span></a>. It's basically free as well as fantastic, making it the obvious choice. The non-Exalted versions will be worse, especially without the proc, but you'll get Exalted eventually. <br/>
<br/>Most other Rings are very close in performance. If you need Hit, grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50714/valanars-other-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valanar's Other Signet Ring</span></a>, if you spent your formative years in GDKPs, you could grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51557/runed-signet-of-the-kirin-tor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Signet of the Kirin Tor</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44636/enchant-ring-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Spellpower</span></a> -  Only Enchanters can benefit from Ring Enchants.<div class="pad"></div>
