<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 4</h3>Look at the beauty that is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50365/phylactery-of-the-nameless-lich">
